  "caveats": [
    "Measurements are source layout units, not verified screen pixels. Profiles, scaling, inheritance and dynamic widget behavior affect rendering.",
    "Raw monster HP/damage are scaling inputs, not effective in-game values. Difficulty, level, players and other engine state can alter outcomes.",
    "Historical 25 Hz simulation must not be presented as D2R timing measured here. UI animation fps and drop sound frame numbers are not a measured simulation tick.",
    "Blank delay cells do not imply instant attacks. Animation attack-rate and engine state control timing. Raw weapon speed is not milliseconds.",
    "Installation edition label and build metadata do not prove an unmodified official release. No gameplay execution or screenshot validation performed in this inspection.",
    "CascLib reads the local archive normally. No game loader, external key acquisition, online archive connection or bypass flags used.",
    "Raw proprietary files are retained outside the Verdigris repository for private reference only. Findings are original scalar observations."
